=2 Walkthrough
__This quest automatically is flagged after completing the previous quest, {q:The Truth Beckons|The Truth Beckons|The Truth Beckons}.__
* Before progressing, you must obtain a new {@k} {k:Traverser stone} from {n:Joachim}. You will need to wait until his restock timer is up.
* Examine any of the following {p:Cavernous Maws|Cavernous Maw} to begin the corresponding quests.
** This can be done if you have the 1 hour lockout from the last quest but still have a Traverser Stone.
** After flagging one of these quests, you unlock the ability to teleport to the corresponding maw for a fee of 200 {p:Cruor}.
** Teleportation can be done via {p:these abyssea maw teleportation NPCs|Category:Abyssea}.
* You must complete __any three__ of these sub-quests to proceed with the next main Abyssea quest.

>**Vision of Abyssea**
* Examine the {p:Cavernous Maw} in {z:Konschtat Highlands} at (I-12) to start the quest {q:To Paste a Peiste|To Paste a Peiste|To Paste a Peiste}.
** {p:Survival Guide} in {z:North Gustaberg} is close.
* Examine the {p:Cavernous Maw} in {z:Tahrongi Canyon} at (H-12) for the quest {q:Megadrile Menace|Megadrile Menace|Megadrile Menace}.
** Unity Wanted Battle lv.99 to {z:Tahrongi Canyon} is close.
* Examine the {p:Cavernous Maw} in {z:La Theine Plateau} at (E-4) for the quest {q:A Goldstruck Gigas|A Goldstruck Gigas|A Goldstruck Gigas}.
** {p:Survival Guide} in {z:West Ronfaure} is close.

>**Scars of Abyssea**
* Examine the {p:Cavernous Maw} in {z:Jugner Forest} at (J-8) to start the quest the quest {q:The Beast of Bastore|The Beast of Bastore|The Beast of Bastore}.
** {p:Survival Guide} in {z:Jugner Forest} is close.
* Examine the {p:Cavernous Maw} in {z:Buburimu Peninsula} at (F-7) for the quest {q:A Fluttery Fiend|A Fluttery Fiend|A Fluttery Fiend}.
** {p:Survival Guide} in {z:Buburimu Peninsula} is close.
* Examine the {p:Cavernous Maw} in {z:Valkurm Dunes} at (I-9) for the quest {q:A Delectable Demon|A Delectable Demon|A Delectable Demon}.
** {p:Survival Guide} in {z:Valkurm Dunes} is close.

